WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Open your task workspace.
Choose Tasks from the sidebar.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:17.500 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Give the task a clear outcome.
Add task opens the real task form.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:27.317 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Add the definition of done.
A short description makes the expected result clear.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:34.333 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Find the new work.
Search filters the current list without changing the record.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:40.600 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Record that it is finished.
Use the task completion control only after the work is done.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:49.550 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Return to the remaining work.
Clear the search. Your unfinished tasks stay ready for the next action.
